# Allowlist approach: ignore everything, then re-include only deployable files.
# Keeps raw photos (877MB), transcripts, notes, and PDFs out of the public repo.
*

!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!index.html
!landing-cpff.html
!landing-kenrusk.html

# Interactive homepage concept (POC) pages + the assets they use
!poc-cpff.html
!poc-kenrusk.html
!cpff.png
!kenrusk.png
!mockup_cpff.png
!mockup_kenrusk.png

!assets/
!assets/**

!images/
images/*
!images/web/
!images/web/**
!images/CPF-Bourbon-Bottle-badge.png
